{
  "comment": "30-task Execute reliability eval set. Split 6 per category, half happy-path / half rough-edges. Each entry's `notification` is injected directly via the automation bridge to skip the real TaskAssistant promotion loop. `ground_truth` is consumed by graders/<category>.py.",
